# Coding-agent configuration and working files. These belong to whichever tool
# a contributor happens to drive the repo with, not to the project: they carry
# machine-local paths, hook commands and vendor-specific schemas, and a fresh
# checkout is expected to build without any of them. Keep them on disk, out of
# the history.
.agents/
.claude/
.codex/
.cursor/
.cursorrules
.windsurf/
.windsurfrules
.aider*
.continue/
.gemini/
.opencode/
.roo/
.roomodes
.specstory/
.mcp.json
.github/copilot-instructions.md

# Agent working notes: the log kept between sessions, under each tool's name.
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md
GEMINI.md

# Scratch space for agent-driven visual checks — a throwaway browser profile
# and whatever screenshots a session captured.
.tmp-visual-qa/
